{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10100240","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010024001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">金麦村の北村</style>の麦畑も、近々<style=\"highlight\">フランツ</style>が買い占めるそうだ！","source_cn":"听说<style=highlight>金穗北村</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB7F32A9DC5A204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010024002:0":{"text":"このままじゃ、近いうちに北村も<style=\"highlight\">南村</style>みたいに、<style=\"highlight\">高価なブドウ</style>を栽培することになるかも。","source_cn":"要不了多久，北村也会和<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A708C7413CF7627","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010024003:0":{"text":"なんだって！？金麦村の村長はブドウの栽培に反対してたはずだろ？結局折れたのか？","source_cn":"什么？！金穗村的老村长不是一直都很反对种葡萄？他最终还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30FD68016049E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010024004:0":{"text":"しょうがないさ。ここ二年で、南村はブドウのおかげでどんどん裕福になってる。","source_cn":"没办法……你看这两年，南村的人各个鼓起腰包，不就是因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD079479E28BDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010024005:0":{"text":"北村も黙ってられないよな。誰だって裕福な暮らしがしたいよ。村長一人じゃどうにもならなかったんだろうな。","source_cn":"北村看着也眼馋啊，谁不想过上更富裕的日子呢？光靠老村长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B5DF9F36906CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010024006:0":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様……もし南も北もブドウだらけになったら、金麦村はもうブドウ村に改名するしかないよ！","source_cn":"艾雅在上……要是南边和北边都种葡萄，金穗村改名叫葡萄村得了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75F23EEB4018BB2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:汤姆":{"text":"トム","source":"汤姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:托尼":{"text":"トニー","source":"托尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}